        "quote": "solving 12.47% (286/2,294) of the full SWE-bench test set and 18.00% (54/300) of the Lite split."
      },
      {
        "kind": "strength",
        "claim": "Concrete Lite-set ablations test interface choices, including editing with linting. The reported improvement supports the claim that interface design matters in this setup, without establishing generalization to other benchmarks.",
