        "quote": "This intervention improves performance considerably (Without Linting, 15.0% ↓ 3.0)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "limitation",
        "claim": "The final interface was partly shaped through qualitative analysis on hand-picked, easier development examples. This is a scope and potential selection concern about the design process, not evidence that the test results are invalid.",
