        "kind": "uncertainty",
        "claim": "The inspected table gives a full-set RAG result for Claude 3 Opus, while the reported full-set SWE-agent result uses GPT-4 Turbo. This does not establish a matched-model comparison; other pages were not inspected for further qualifications.",
