      "finding": "The inspected extracts mention common failure behaviors and design selection using hand-picked easier development examples, but do not establish the paper’s complete limitations or discussion.",
      "support": ["E14", "E16"],
      "counterevidence": [],
      "unknown": "Pages 2, 8, and 11–25 were not inspected; page 9 is only a partial extract. The full limitations, discussion, and evaluation caveats remain unknown."
    }
  ],
  "changes": "Corrected the second observation’s quotation and page citation to the verified page 7 passage. Preserved the existing score and noted the gaps in inspected material."
